{"kelime":"تابوت","maddeler":[{"w":"تابوت","u":"تابوت","p":"noun","h":"ar-noun","e":"تَابُوت • (tābūt) m (plural تَوَابِيت (tawābīt))","t":"Etymology tree\nEgyptian ḏbꜣ\nEgyptian -t\nEgyptian ḏbꜣtder.\nEgyptian dbtder.\nClassical Syriac ܬܝܒܘܬܐ (tēḇūṯā)bor.\n▲\nEgyptian ḏbꜣtder.\nEgyptian dbtder.\nGe'ez ታቦት (tabot)bor.\nArabic تَاوْبُوَّة /تَوَبُوت (tawabūt / tāwbuwwa)\nArabic تابوت\nFrom earlier تَوَبُوت (tawabūt) or تَاوْبُوَّة (tāwbuwwa), from Classical Syriac ܬܝܒܘܬܐ (tēḇūṯā) or Ge'ez ታቦት (tabot). Cognate with Hebrew תיבה (tevá).\nUltimately from a merger of Egyptian DbA-b-t:pr (ḏbꜣt, “sarcophagus, coffin”) and d-b-t:xt (dbt, “chest, box”); compare Demotic Egyptian tbyt (“sarcophagus, shrine, chest”), dbt, and tbt (“chest”) and Coptic ⲧⲁⲓⲃⲉ (taibe, “chest, coffin”).","s":[["bor","Classical Syriac ܬܝܒܘܬܐ (tēḇūṯā)"],["bor","Ge'ez ታቦት (tabot)"],["cog","Hebrew תיבה (tevá)"],["egy-h","DbA-b-t:pr"],["der","Egyptian DbA-b-t:pr (ḏbꜣt, “sarcophagus, coffin”)"],["egy-h","d-b-t:xt"],["cog","Demotic Egyptian tbyt (“sarcophagus, shrine, chest”)"],["cog","Coptic ⲧⲁⲓⲃⲉ (taibe, “chest, coffin”)"]],"g":["box, case, chest, coffer, ark","coffin, casket, sarcophagus"],"r":["tābūt"],"ipa":["/taː.buːt/"],"ds":[["mt","tebut",""],["az","",""],["ba","табут","tabut"],["ca","taüt",""],["crh","tabut",""],["en","taboot",""],["en","tabut",""],["gl","ataúde",""],["kaa","tabıt",""],["kk","табыт","tabıt"],["ku","",""],["ky","табыт","tabıt"],["axm","թաբուտ","tʻabut"],["axm","թապութ","tʻaputʻ"],["axm","թաւութ","tʻawutʻ"],["xcl","թափուտ","tʻapʻut"],["nap","tauto",""],["nap","tavuto",""],["oc","ataüt",""],["oc","ataüc",""],["ota","تَابُوت","tâbût"],["fa-cls","تَابُوت","tābūt"],["pt","ataúde",""],["scn","tabbutu",""],["alt","табыт","tabït"],["es","ataúd",""],["tt","табут","tabut"],["tk","tabyt",""],["ug","تاۋۇت","tawut"],["uz","tobut",""],["uz","tovut",""],["zza","tabut",""]],"dr":["تَابُوت الْعَهْد","تَابُوت رَفْعِ الْمِيَاهِ"],"el":[["ḏbꜣ","ḏbꜣ#Egyptian"],["-t","-t#Egyptian"],["ḏbꜣt","ḏbꜣt#Egyptian"